sheet.prompt:
A sprite sheet of {count} different inventory item icons for {style.world}. The items are arranged in an exact grid of {rows} rows x {cols} columns of equal cells spread evenly over the whole image. Every cell holds exactly ONE item, centered in its cell and filling about 70 percent of the cell, with wide empty gaps between items; no item touches, overlaps or crosses into another cell. Every item is clearly different from the others. Items in row-major order (left to right, then top to bottom):
{cells}
{empty}Style: {style.icon}, {style.original}. {style.keyBg}. {style.noText}.
